{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taker your time, relax, and join Mimi on her new feline adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mimi has lost her favorite ball and now depends on you to bring the fun back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119480/extras/aeca73409085abdf933e9cd3119fa024.poster.avif?t=1770072006\" width=860 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119480/extras/aeca73409085abdf933e9cd3119fa024.webm?t=1770072006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119480/extras/aeca73409085abdf933e9cd3119fa024.mp4?t=1770072006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn from your mistakes, retrace your steps if needed, and find the best way to guide her to her ball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119480/extras/2264f68f8636b4d2a7ca36da676242fa.poster.avif?t=1770072006\" width=860 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119480/extras/2264f68f8636b4d2a7ca36da676242fa.webm?t=1770072006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119480/extras/2264f68f8636b4d2a7ca36da676242fa.mp4?t=1770072006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mimi can get distracted by other things or even wet her little paws \u2014 but it\u2019s all for one reason: to play with her beloved ball again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119480/extras/7ff8e6eaac2c51ad11d39558ea5c1ef0.poster.avif?t=1770072006\" width=860 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119480/extras/7ff8e6eaac2c51ad11d39558ea5c1ef0.webm?t=1770072006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119480/extras/7ff8e6eaac2c51ad11d39558ea5c1ef0.mp4?t=1770072006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you\u2019ll find:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2665 60 cozy puzzle levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2665 Intuitive and relaxing gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2665 Achievements to collect</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2665 An adorable kitty that will steal your heart</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Expedition","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4119480/feb3ee5f588202f26450a30e077218b65ed26d9a.jpg"},{"name":"Can I have two toys?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4119480/05ca19a18bf0b2caad9d27634e127ed478b68f86.jpg"},{"name":"Paper is fun too","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4119480/5cfcde92c1f9fc0a81cd0b6bea05088a0eb4c494.jpg"},{"name":"Water isn\u2019t that fun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4119480/44d673d554e994c66e60eaeecd7b7babbd305ec1.jpg"},{"name":"Bugs Bugs Bugs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4119480/cb8afc5732a50e19bc0656e4739a7e8d973e8fa1.jpg"},{"name":"Level 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4119480/cecff1ca342c418f7e4a38e01b7ee960a66c8fbb.jpg"},{"name":"Level 20","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4119480/f5bdeed53064a396a113490004d845d266b01832.jpg"},{"name":"So this is wool?","path":"https://